  "metadata": {
    "title": "Electrical tomography resistivity (ERT) monitoring time series",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7371124",
    "publication_date": "2022-01-31",
    "description": "<p>Multi-temporal electrical tomography resistivity (ERT) measurements for monitoring the performance of the bio-degradable bentonite mat in OAL-Austria. The first measurement was conducted on 30 July 2020 before the implementation of the mat, afterwards seasonal measurement (except for winter due to snow cover) were obtained: 19 Oct 2020, 27 Arpil 2021, 10 August 2021, 4 October 2021, 13 April 2022. A time-lapse inversion algorithm was used to prepare the final results. See OPERANDUM deliverable 4.6 for more details.</p>\n\n<p>Device: Lippmann 4point light 10 W</p>",
